🇷🇸🇷🇺 Vučić congratulates Putin on successful State Duma elections

Key points from the call:

➡️The phone conversation between Putin and Serbian President Aleksandar Vučić took place at the Serbian side's initiative;

➡️The two leaders discussed developing Russia-Serbia relations, including in energy, oil and gas, transport, and healthcare;

➡️Current international issues were also on the agenda, including the conflict in Ukraine;

➡️Vučić thanked Russia for its comprehensive support of Serbia and expressed particular gratitude for assistance in fighting wildfires;

➡️Vučić briefed Putin on preparations for Serbia's snap parliamentary elections, with both sides stressing that foreign interference is unacceptable;

➡️Vučić informed Putin of his upcoming resignation and thanked the Russian president for years of cooperation.

